# TrackRush Pro needs no API keys or accounts. It is built entirely on free, local tools.
# This file only lists the optional settings, so nobody ever has to put a secret in the repo.
# Copy to .env (git ignores it) if you want to change them.

# Port for the optional 1 vs 1 relay server (npm run server).
PORT=

# Where the relay server keeps its leaderboard file (git ignores server/data/).
# BOARD_FILE=server/data/board.json
# PLAYERS_FILE=server/data/players.json
